WEBVTT

00:00:00.142 --> 00:00:02.833
Open Calculators and create a private floor slab study.

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:06.098
The 150 mm slab weighs 3.75 kPa. Increase the imposed floor load from 1.50 to 3.00 kPa.

00:00:06.098 --> 00:00:15.237
Service load becomes 6.75 kPa. Compare the four reinforcement positions with the source worksheet.

00:00:15.237 --> 00:00:20.656
Switch to a 6 m simply supported, bonded post-tensioned strip. Inspect transfer and short-term service response.

00:00:20.656 --> 00:00:25.041
Reduce the effective tendon force from 300 to 240 kN. The ultimate external moment stays at 44.82 kNm.

00:00:25.041 --> 00:00:30.452
Midspan service displacement rises from 3.77 to 4.33 mm. Save and reopen to reproduce the result.

00:00:30.452 --> 00:00:37.751
Read the stage assumptions and calculation pages in the browser. The engineer reviews losses and member resistance.
